<title>UK: Spain sets 2.0 billion mark 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Spain sets 2.0 billion mark 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPAIN</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    03.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.01    PAY DATE    03.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    98.835    SPREAD	+24 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ES</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  SPAIN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  2.175     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND APRIL 2006 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
